    {
      "subId": "302814",
      "subQuestName": "进入大慈树王最后的记忆中",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "302813",
      "subQuestName": "与纳西妲对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "30281301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "30281301": {
            "id": "30281301",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这里怎么和我想象的不一样…不是应该进到那个有着世界树存在的意识空间吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281302"
            ]
          },
          "30281302": {
            "id": "30281302",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "纳西妲",
            "text": "那的确是我们此行的终点，但我也没想到，原来大慈树王残留的意识受到了如此严重的污染。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281303"
            ]
          },
          "30281303": {
            "id": "30281303",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "污染…？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281306"
            ]
          },
          "30281306": {
            "id": "30281306",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "纳西妲",
            "text": "禁忌知识？你们居然知道连我都不是很清楚的概念…可以详细说说么？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281307"
            ]
          },
          "30281307": {
            "id": "30281307",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "和纳西妲详细讲述了在沙漠中的见闻。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281308"
            ]
          },
          "30281308": {
            "id": "30281308",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "纳西妲",
            "text": "你们的推断不无道理…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281309"
            ]
          },
          "30281309": {
            "id": "30281309",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "纳西妲",
            "text": "千年前的沙漠出现过一次禁忌知识的污染，依靠赤王的自我牺牲与大慈树王的透支力量才成功驱逐。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281310"
            ]
          },
          "30281310": {
            "id": "30281310",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "纳西妲",
            "text": "不难相信是五百年前的坎瑞亚灾变中，又出现了第二次禁忌知识污染。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281311"
            ]
          },
          "30281311": {
            "id": "30281311",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "纳西妲",
            "text": "而这次恐怕更严重，已经危及到了世界树。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281312"
            ]
          },
          "30281312": {
            "id": "30281312",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "那既然这里作为大慈树王残留的意识，也受到了禁忌知识的污染，那是不是说大慈树王的死…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281313"
            ]
          },
          "30281313": {
            "id": "30281313",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "纳西妲",
            "text": "嗯，她很有可能是在与禁忌知识的对抗中献出了生命。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281314"
            ]
          },
          "30281314": {
            "id": "30281314",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "纳西妲",
            "text": "尽管这次禁忌知识未能根除，但如果不是她做了些什么，这五百年来不可能只有那么少的污染征兆出现。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281315"
            ]
          },
          "30281315": {
            "id": "30281315",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "纳西妲",
            "text": "包括我在内，大家对禁忌知识这一概念的忘却，应该也是她修复世界树的影响。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281316"
            ]
          },
          "30281316": {
            "id": "30281316",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "纳西妲",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281317"
            ]
          },
          "30281317": {
            "id": "30281317",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "你在伤心吗，纳西妲…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281318"
            ]
          },
          "30281318": {
            "id": "30281318",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "纳西妲",
            "text": "…我在感受她的痛苦。这里意识的污染如此严重，到处都透露着疯狂、混乱、苦痛。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281319"
            ]
          },
          "30281319": {
            "id": "30281319",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "纳西妲",
            "text": "她就是在这样的情况下，坚持与禁忌知识的污染对抗，直到死去的吗…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281320"
            ]
          },
          "30281320": {
            "id": "30281320",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "纳西妲",
            "text": "甚至还用最后残留的一丝清醒意识，为我们留下了线索…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "302815",
      "subQuestName": "依靠意识之舟离开此地",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "302816",
      "subQuestName": "与纳西妲对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "30281601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "30281601": {
            "id": "30281601",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "航向转变了，现在方向对了吗，纳西妲？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281602"
            ]
          },
          "30281602": {
            "id": "30281602",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "纳西妲",
            "text": "嗯，按照现在的航线，「意识之舟」很快就会带我们离开这里。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281603"
            ]
          },
          "30281603": {
            "id": "30281603",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "纳西妲",
            "text": "目的地就快到了，大家都还清醒吧？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281606"
            ]
          },
          "30281606": {
            "id": "30281606",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "欸，我怎么觉得一切正常呀…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281607"
            ]
          },
          "30281607": {
            "id": "30281607",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "纳西妲",
            "text": "希望不再会有变数了，这次应该能见到大慈树王了吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281608"
            ]
          },
          "30281608": {
            "id": "30281608",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "话说，纳西妲也从来没见过大慈树王吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281609"
            ]
          },
          "30281609": {
            "id": "30281609",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "纳西妲",
            "text": "没有哦，我的诞生与她的死去似乎是同时的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281610"
            ]
          },
          "30281610": {
            "id": "30281610",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "纳西妲",
            "text": "若非如此，我想她一定会给我更多的指引，我也能比现在做得更好。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281611"
            ]
          },
          "30281611": {
            "id": "30281611",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "你已经做得很好啦…我们走吧，快点离开这个让人不舒服的地方，去见她！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "302817",
      "subQuestName": "前往曾经的世界树下",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "302818",
      "subQuestName": "找到大慈树王残留的意识",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "30281801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "30281801": {
            "id": "30281801",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "纳西妲",
            "text": "就是这里了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281804"
            ]
          },
          "30281804": {
            "id": "30281804",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "我们…我们是来找大慈树王的…对吧？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281805"
            ]
          },
          "30281805": {
            "id": "30281805",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "可站在那里的是…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281806"
            ]
          },
          "30281806": {
            "id": "30281806",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "纳西妲",
            "text": "我…？和我一模一样…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281807"
            ]
          },
          "30281807": {
            "id": "30281807",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "纳西妲",
            "text": "你就是…大慈树王？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30281808"
            ]
          },
          "30281808": {
            "id": "30281808",
            "speakerId": 12826,
            "speakerName": "大慈树王",
            "text": "嗯，就是我。这副样子…让你很惊讶么？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "302820",
      "subQuestName": "与纳西妲对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "302821",
      "subQuestName": "与纳西妲对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "30282101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "30282101": {
            "id": "30282101",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "纳西妲",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30282104"
            ]
          },
          "30282104": {
            "id": "30282104",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "纳西妲",
            "text": "#啊，{NICKNAME}。我…还好，只是稍微有点不明白。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30282105"
            ]
          },
          "30282105": {
            "id": "30282105",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "不明白什么？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30282106"
            ]
          },
          "30282106": {
            "id": "30282106",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "纳西妲",
            "text": "我们刚刚拯救了世界对么？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30282107"
            ]
          },
          "30282107": {
            "id": "30282107",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "纳西妲",
            "text": "可是为什么…我好像在哭呢？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "302812",
      "subQuestName": "与派蒙对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "30260101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "30260101": {
            "id": "30260101",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "…醒来…好的！我会…嗯！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30260102"
            ]
          },
          "30260102": {
            "id": "30260102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（唔…）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30260103"
            ]
          },
          "30260103": {
            "id": "30260103",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "你醒啦？刚好柯莱喊我们吃早餐，快起来吧！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30260104"
            ]
          },
          "30260104": {
            "id": "30260104",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "早啊，派蒙。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30260105"
            ]
          },
          "30260105": {
            "id": "30260105",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "早上好！今天感觉怎么样？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30260106"
            ]
          },
          "30260106": {
            "id": "30260106",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "还不错哦。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30260107"
            ]
          },
          "30260107": {
            "id": "30260107",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "那就好，看来我们已经恢复得很不错了，就算是提纳里也不会阻止我们出门了吧？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30260108"
            ]
          },
          "30260108": {
            "id": "30260108",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "嗯。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30260109"
            ]
          },
          "30260109": {
            "id": "30260109",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（那一天，我们在战斗中失去了意识…醒来之后发现自己身处化城郭，提纳里和柯莱负责照看我们。）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30260110"
            ]
          },
          "30260110": {
            "id": "30260110",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（听说是赛诺送我们来的。提纳里虽然抱怨赛诺总是往他这里送人，对我们却非常关照。）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30260111"
            ]
          },
          "30260111": {
            "id": "30260111",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（消耗过度的我们在这里得到了充分休息。几天过去，也算是恢复到了可以出门的水平。）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30260112"
            ]
          },
          "30260112": {
            "id": "30260112",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（听提纳里和柯莱说，虚空主机彻底关闭，须弥人将不再依赖它。）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30260113"
            ]
          },
          "30260113": {
            "id": "30260113",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（如此大的变化，一定会对很多人生活造成影响吧…但，肯定会是好事。）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30260114"
            ]
          },
          "30260114": {
            "id": "30260114",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "我们赶快出去吧！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "302236",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "30223601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "30223601": {
            "id": "30223601",
            "speakerId": 12809,
            "speakerName": "观察倒下的卫兵…",
            "text": "（眼前这两个人被打晕了，虚空终端也被卸了下来。应该是倒下没多久，似乎还没人发现他们…）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30223602"
            ]
          },
          "30223602": {
            "id": "30223602",
            "speakerId": 12809,
            "speakerName": "观察倒下的卫兵…",
            "text": "（假如他们晕倒前是在押送什么人的话，那个人一定已经顺利脱身了。）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "302699",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "30269901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "30269901": {
            "id": "30269901",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "到约定的日子了，我们去大巴扎看看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "302822",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "30282213"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "30282213": {
            "id": "30282213",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "自那以后，十数日过去了…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "302850",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "30285001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "30285001": {
            "id": "30285001",
            "speakerId": 12808,
            "speakerName": "维拉夫",
            "text": "金发的旅行者？你们怎么从净善宫里出来，那可是平时严格禁止进入的地点啊。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30285002"
            ]
          },
          "30285002": {
            "id": "30285002",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这个…我们不懂规矩嘛…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30285003"
            ]
          },
          "30285003": {
            "id": "30285003",
            "speakerId": 12808,
            "speakerName": "维拉夫",
            "text": "好吧，下次注意。我正在找大贤者阿扎尔，你们有看到他么？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30285004"
            ]
          },
          "30285004": {
            "id": "30285004",
            "speakerId": 12808,
            "speakerName": "维拉夫",
            "text": "我越想越觉得，艾尔海森前辈的归来好像有点蹊跷，一定要想办法通知大贤者…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30285005"
            ]
          },
          "30285005": {
            "id": "30285005",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "原来你刚开始这么想呀…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "302851",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "30285101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "30285101": {
            "id": "30285101",
            "speakerId": 12653,
            "speakerName": "毗伽尔",
            "text": "哟，是你们啊，计划完成得怎么样了，是来找妮露么？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30285102"
            ]
          },
          "30285102": {
            "id": "30285102",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "计划非常顺利。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30285103"
            ]
          },
          "30285103": {
            "id": "30285103",
            "speakerId": 12653,
            "speakerName": "毗伽尔",
            "text": "那就好，妮露已经回大巴扎去了，刚才一大群教令院的学生围上来想要妮露的签名，我看到她落荒而逃。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30285104"
            ]
          },
          "30285104": {
            "id": "30285104",
            "speakerId": 12653,
            "speakerName": "毗伽尔",
            "text": "教令院还想禁止艺术演出…呵呵，我看他们的学生第一个不同意。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "302852",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "30285201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "30285201": {
            "id": "30285201",
            "speakerId": 12709,
            "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
            "text": "欸？你们怎么有功夫跑出来的，小吉祥草王救到了么？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30285202"
            ]
          },
          "30285202": {
            "id": "30285202",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "救到啦，她现在正在处理虚空的事。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30285203"
            ]
          },
          "30285203": {
            "id": "30285203",
            "speakerId": 12709,
            "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
            "text": "不错嘛，哈哈。刚才迪希雅找到「三十人团」的老顾问阿斯法德，向他详细说明了情况。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30285204"
            ]
          },
          "30285204": {
            "id": "30285204",
            "speakerId": 12709,
            "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
            "text": "结果阿斯法德的反应是「为什么不早说，如果是为了拯救神明，我们也会帮忙的」，哈哈哈…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30285205"
            ]
          },
          "30285205": {
            "id": "30285205",
            "speakerId": 12709,
            "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
            "text": "想不到就连城里的「三十人团」卫兵们都可以当做援军，我们原先的战术看来还是太保守了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "302899",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "30289901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "30289901": {
            "id": "30289901",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#趁现在好好做一下战斗准备吧，{NICKNAME}。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30289902"
            ]
          },
          "30289902": {
            "id": "30289902",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "准备好了的话，也可以四处逛逛，毕竟我们关禁闭的时候错过了很多嘛。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30289906"
            ]
          },
          "30289906": {
            "id": "30289906",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "地面上的花纹好像被打乱了，我们到周围看看有没有什么办法把它复原吧？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30289907"
            ]
          },
          "30289907": {
            "id": "30289907",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "好像停下来了，我们坐上去看看吧？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30289909"
            ]
          },
          "30289909": {
            "id": "30289909",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这里是…空中吗？怎么会有一艘巨大的船在那里！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30289910"
            ]
          },
          "30289910": {
            "id": "30289910",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "纳西妲",
            "text": "那是象征着理智的「意识之舟」，它的航向便是我们意识去往的方向。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "30289911"
            ]
          },
          "30289911": {
            "id": "30289911",
            "speakerId": 1056,
            "speakerName": "纳西妲",
            "text": "如果意识脱离掌控，就会陷入疯狂…所以，想办法去把控好「航线」吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}